    "title": "North shuts out Castle to advance to sectional semifinals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ayden Crowley ,\n1 hours ago NEWBURGH, Ind. (WEHT) — A Kayla Delph second half goal was the difference in the North Huskies 1-0 win over the Castle Knights.\nThe Huskies advance to play the Reitz Panthers in the sectional semifinals.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
